      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town campaigned to be the Nebraska Territory's capital but lost the bid to Omaha.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fontanelle%2C_Nebraska",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Early settlers faced Pawnee raids, and Fontanelle's growth stalled after a railroad never reached the town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
